## Next Steps (Manual)

1. **Create GitHub App** at https://github.com/settings/apps/new:
   - Name: `ai-code-review-bot`
   - Homepage: `https://ai-code-review-bot-five.vercel.app`
   - Webhook URL: `https://ai-code-review-bot-five.vercel.app/api/webhook`
   - Webhook secret: generate random string
   - Permissions:
     - Pull requests: Read & Write
     - Checks: Read & Write
     - Contents: Read
     - Metadata: Read
   - Events: Pull request (opened, synchronize, reopened)

2. **Add Vercel Environment Variables** (Settings → Environment Variables):
   ```
   GITHUB_APP_ID=<from GitHub App>
   GITHUB_PRIVATE_KEY=<generate from GitHub App>
   GITHUB_WEBHOOK_SECRET=<from step 1>
   GITHUB_TOKEN=<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>
   NVIDIA_API_KEY=<rotated key from earlier>
   ```

3. **Install GitHub App** on target repos (or own account)

4. **Test**: Open a PR → webhook triggers → review appears in Checks tab

